{"title": "Yeenoghu", "pageid": 21726, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Yeenoghu", "categories": ["Fiends", "Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Yeenoghu</b> is a Demon Lord mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Holy, good holy. We follow Yeenoghu holy. He makes us hungry. Always hungry.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b><a href=\"/wiki/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\">Hyena</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a></b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Yeenoghu's chosen are <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnolls</a>, insatiably hungry monstrosities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_creatures\">Related creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flind\" title=\"Flind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/25px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/38px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/50px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Flind.png/25px-Portrait_Flind.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" 